.TH BENTOPACK 1 "September 2026" "BentoPack 0.11.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bentopack \- interactive 2D sprite sheet preparation, retouching, animation and game engine packing studio
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bentopack
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bentopack
is an advanced desktop graphical workstation designed for video game creators, pixel artists, and technical animators.
It bridges the gap between raw artwork creation and game engine asset pipelines by providing:
.IP \(bu 2
Precise sprite sheet slicing with automatic connected-components edge detection and interactive boundary box manipulation.
.IP \(bu 2
Comprehensive animation management with timeline filmstrip, FPS speed control, and loop modes (Loop, Once, Ping-Pong).
.IP \(bu 2
Interactive origin and pivot alignment reticles eliminating animation jittering across variable-dimension frames.
.IP \(bu 2
A modular suite of non-destructive image filters (background removal, anti-halo despill, outline generator, color swapping, HSV adjust, pixel rescaling, and retro Bayer quantization).
.IP \(bu 2
High-density 2D atlas packing powered by MaxRects heuristics and multithreaded Tight Polygon Mesh packing (Marching Squares, RDP simplification, and Ear-Clipping triangulation saving 60% to 80% GPU overdraw).
.IP \(bu 2
A surgical pixel-by-pixel editor featuring continuous Bresenham drawing, floating clipboard stamps, dynamic palette extraction, and authentic retro hardware palettes (NES, SNES, Amiga, PC-Engine, Game Boy, PICO-8, C64).
.IP \(bu 2
Native project preservation (\fB.bento\fR / \fB.ssp\fR) with atomic writes, crash recovery, and integrated Git Time-Travel versioning.
.IP \(bu 2
Multi-engine exports targeting Godot 4 (\fB.tres\fR), Unity 2D (\fB.unity.json\fR), Unreal Engine Paper2D (\fB.paper2d.json\fR), TexturePacker JSON, GIF animations, and transparent PNG archives.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
Display command-line help options.
.TP
.B \-v\fR, \fB\-\-version
Print application version and build information.
.TP
.B \-\-reset\-config
Reset application settings and user preferences stored in \fIbentopack_config.json\fR to defaults.

.SH SUPPORTED FILE FORMATS
.SS Project Files
.TP
.B .bento\fR, \fB.ssp
Native BentoPack Project archive (compressed ZIP containing canvas textures, slice coordinates, pivots, animations, and revision snapshots).
.SS Image Formats
.TP
.B PNG, WEBP, JPEG, BMP
Standard lossless and raster image formats for source sheets and generated texture atlases.
.TP
.B GIF
Animated GIFs parsed and unpacked frame-by-frame with preservation of individual frame timing and transparent color keys.
.TP
.B KTX2 (Basis Universal)
GPU-compressed texture format utilizing ETC1S / UASTC supercompression and Zstandard for minimal VRAM footprint across PC, mobile, and web targets.

.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
.B BENTOPACK_PLUGIN_PATH
Colon-separated list of directories searched for external dynamic filter and extractor plugins (\fB.so\fR / \fB.dll\fR).
.TP
.B QT_QPA_PLATFORM
Specifies the Qt platform abstraction plugin (e.g. \fBwayland\fR, \fBxcb\fR, \fBwindows\fR, \fBcocoa\fR).

.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/BentoPack/bentopack_config.json
User preferences and application geometry settings.

